# Files in this repo that must NOT be uploaded as public site assets.
# Same syntax as .gitignore.
#
# Two things this prevents, both observed in real builds:
#  - `.git` being served publicly — the build clones the repo, so .git/objects, .git/index and
#    .git/config all land in the assets directory and get uploaded unless excluded.
#  - node_modules being uploaded, which fails the build outright: it contains a 127 MB workerd
#    binary and Cloudflare caps a single asset at 25 MiB.

.git
node_modules
.wrangler
tools
src/site/landing.template.html
package.json
package-lock.json
bun.lock
bun.lockb
wrangler.jsonc
.assetsignore
.gitattributes
.gitignore
*.md
Claude outputs
